    "data": "<h1 style=\"margin: 16px 0; font-size: 26px !important;\">Biliboard术力口周榜</h1><p>创刊于2024年6月12日，继承自日本Billboard周榜，收录包括但不限于使用VOCALOID、UTAU、SynthesizerV、CEVIO、初音ミクNT等音声合成引擎制作的歌曲（统称“术曲”），旨在针对B站的流行趋势对术曲排名，并传播日本虚拟歌姬文化。</p><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img class=\"cut-off-6\" alt=\"cut-off-6\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/article/02db465212d3c374a43c60fa2625cc1caeaab796.png\"></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">排名计算方式</h1><p>0、数据统计周期为上周周二12点至本周周二12点</p><p>1、时间修正</p><p>t = LOG(EXP(DATE([投稿日期])-DATE([最近一期周榜的发布时间的前一天]))/14 + 1)+1</p><p>2、得分计算</p><p>播放基数 = 新增播放 * 时间修正</p><p>得分 = 播放基数 + 新增收藏 * 30 + 新增点赞 * 3 + 新增硬币 * 10 + (投票比值 + 100%) * 播放基数</p><p>投票&amp;提名网站: <a href=\"https://aquarite.uk\">https://aquarite.uk</a></p><p>排名并不完全等同于歌曲质量，请理性看待！</p><p>PS：点击名次后方的歌名可以直接跳转对应曲目的站内视频哦</p><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img class=\"cut-off-5\" alt=\"cut-off-5\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/article/4adb9255ada5b97061e610b682b8636764fe50ed.png\"></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 20 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15J4m1A7qy/\" target=\"_blank\">催眠师</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/c4496e1c95132a8dd859f9ad52d92a7e58efec75.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 19 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1f3CrYfEVA/\" target=\"_blank\">糖果曲奇巧克力</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/37297509dbcc22feb3d23ec456a9d71528e05d2d.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 18 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gX1yBREFi/\" target=\"_blank\">无论多少次…</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ac11147084fa601d2dc95aae4f7ed5d6637a4f92.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 17 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1671VB7EAG/\" target=\"_blank\">扭来扭去</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/6061604d29e9919f80979441de9f373dd3fcc851.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 16 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV148tzzVEoK/\" target=\"_blank\">小小的我</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/3b997ab76b99a71344a6f596b7feabd11b1246c8.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 15 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qDUPYKEzf/\" target=\"_blank\">视奸</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/cb57a835ced66703577b203f8dff9075dc2bc95b.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 14 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ZcKdzDE5Q/\" target=\"_blank\">捉迷藏</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/bf52f06cae3e58c1e88ebe8a589f830beb4fab8b.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 13 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1SH1jBGEjn/\" target=\"_blank\">梦之模式 </a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/18e20f809318dfcd0901f29dedc606ee51b2f7ee.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 12 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1YW1RBsEuG/\" target=\"_blank\">我愿意</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/23b9199d9b85f2d9b14ccad2e68ed10d4ce0fbd1.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 11 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1DFhmz2Ehn/\" target=\"_blank\">Doomer</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7f65f1813d0d3a0bbd874ff974c1a8d5ed7f8b89.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 10 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1JThqzwEGq/\" target=\"_blank\">誓见“好朋友”</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/90aa2fb1a20f53fb8d5616e6e2d51898d54f1167.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 9 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1SfK9zPEL3/\" target=\"_blank\">不要听那姓T的话</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/e3e43ede3d0d379f294a3bfc4a8730e07047da8b.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 8 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18WyGBhE5d/\" target=\"_blank\">骚骚</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/17d2cb18e08878b4d5c47cbfaa9764de20e39259.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 7 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FkygB6Eh2/\" target=\"_blank\">配信创意</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/a6e13d1ffb3c2b1a580e5993b097b10d864349aa.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 6 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ijyAB5EMA/\" target=\"_blank\">打字</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/68772aad787f5efe47e24268f848bbc4bab063bf.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 5 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ci1EB6EhX/\" target=\"_blank\">哈哈一笑</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/2684cc7ec217b5a5e3e7a5f409bd9d953158a407.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 4 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1pnHWzkE4j/\" target=\"_blank\">爱属性</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/56bafa53c974f4c60dc258dd42c8f1e9df278488.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; font-size: 23px !important;\">第 3 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1mCy8B6Esm/\" target=\"_blank\">困茧</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7a880427d016d72d58be3923dd8c33a0c81b839b.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1 style=\"margin: 14px 0; f